DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42114::$$$message_0232_0000_0000$$$::"Whew. We're finally here."::
42115::$$$message_0232_0001_0000$$$::"...[se storage=se551.wav]The account is settled between us, for now.[lr]::
42116::$$$message_0232_0001_0001$$$::Goodbye, Executor. I still respect your strength, even if I know what you are now."::
42117::$$$message_0232_0002_0000$$$::"Sella, Sella. I just heard some amazing news."::
42118::$$$message_0232_0002_0001$$$::"Hey, you done with the first bath yet!?[lr]::
42119::$$$message_0232_0002_0002$$$::I'm coming in if you already made your wish!"::
42120::$$$message_0232_0003_0000$$$::"Ook-ook eek-eek!"::
42121::$$$message_0232_0003_0001$$$::"Ook-ook eek?"::
42122::$$$message_0232_0003_0002$$$::"H-hold on![lr]::
42123::$$$message_0232_0003_0003$$$::I never said you could come in...!"::
42124::$$$message_0232_0003_0004$$$::"Can't hear you![lr]::
42125::$$$message_0232_0003_0005$$$::It's a mixed bath, anyway! No reason a guy can't join the fun!"::
42126::$$$message_0232_0004_0000$$$::"Eek! Kee kee, shah shah shah!"::
42127::$$$message_0232_0004_0001$$$::"Aŋra, wait...!"::
42128::$$$message_0232_0004_0002$$$::"Where's my t-towel!?"::
42129::$$$message_0232_0004_0003$$$::"Hehehe, too soft, too slow, I'm comin' to jump yer bones! ...Wait,[hffacechg chara=アヴェンジャー face=呆 layer=1 time=200][hfangry layer=1][hfquake layer=message1 time=600 vmax=5 hmax=5 wait=0] what the!?"[nolr]::
42130::$$$message_0232_0005_0000$$$::"Th-the world has gone dark![lr]::
42131::$$$message_0232_0005_0001$$$::Is our time finally up!?"::
42132::$$$message_0232_0005_0002$$$::"Kee! Kekeke, kee!"[lr]::
42133::$$$message_0232_0005_0003$$$::(Translation: Are you unhurt, fair mademoiselle? On behalf of my fellows, I extend my heartfelt apologies.)[nolr]::
42134::$$$message_0232_0006_0000$$$::"Ah, haah... Th-that was close... [small]Is this some new type of husk...?[rf]"[nolr]::
42135::$$$message_0232_0006_0001$$$::"Gah! No one invited you![lr]::
42136::$$$message_0232_0006_0002$$$::Get off me, you monkey bastard!"::
42137::$$$message_0232_0006_0003$$$::"Kee! Ook ook eek!"[lr]::
42138::$$$message_0232_0006_0004$$$::(Translation: Damn, that's a tiny weenie. I'm disappointed, bro.)[nolr]::
42139::$$$message_0232_0006_0005$$$::"Oh?"[nolr]::
42140::$$$message_0232_0007_0000$$$::"Wait, why are we talking about that, you little prick!?[lr]::
42141::$$$message_0232_0007_0001$$$::Also, I'm in survival mode! I still haven't had my growth spurt yet!"::
42142::$$$message_0232_0007_0002$$$::"Yeek."[lr]::
42143::$$$message_0232_0007_0003$$$::(Translation: Heh. Insecure guys always talk like that.)::
42144::$$$message_0232_0007_0004$$$::"...................................................[hffacechg chara=バゼット face=ニヤリ layer=1 time=200][se storage=se063.wav][hfsigh layer=1]I see."::
42145::$$$message_0232_0007_0005$$$::"What's with the nod of pity!?[lr]::
42146::$$$message_0232_0007_0006$$$::What a disgrace! I've never felt so ashamed!"::
42147::$$$message_0232_0007_0007$$$::"Eek. Ook eek." [lr](Translation: A fine blow, mademoiselle. We shall dispose of this dog in heat. Please, enjoy the resort at your leisure.)::
42148::$$$message_0232_0007_0008$$$::"R-right... Thanks."::
42149::$$$message_0232_0007_0009$$$::"Wait, there's even more of them!?[lr]::
42150::$$$message_0232_0007_0010$$$::Was it me!? [hfangry layer=1][se storage=se555.wav]Is this my fault!?[lr]::
42151::$$$message_0232_0007_0011$$$::Are they mad I got a head start!?"::
42152::$$$message_0232_0007_0012$$$::"...It just goes to show you, Aŋra.[lr]::
42153::$$$message_0232_0007_0013$$$::Getting slaughtered by your own husks... I have a fearsome Servant, indeed."::
42154::$$$message_0232_0008_0000$$$::"...So.[lr]::
42155::$$$message_0232_0008_0001$$$::Should...[hfsweat layer=1]I be helping him?"::

